              total = <span class="font-bold text-amber-700">{usd(bareSwap.total)}</span><br />
              difference = {usd(defaults.total - bareSwap.total)} of code work<br />
              appliance share rises to {fmt(bareSwap.unitShare, 0)}%
            </div>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Result:</span> {usd(bareSwap.total)} — and this is the
              number a low quote is usually built on. If a competing bid is {usd(defaults.total - bareSwap.total)}{" "}
              cheaper, check whether the expansion tank and pan are in it before assuming you are overpriced.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 font-bold">
