            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-4 font-mono text-sm text-slate-700">
              unit {usd(tanklessFull.unit)} + labour 8 h × $110 = {usd(tanklessFull.labour)}<br />
              expansion tank + vent upgrade + gas upsize + condensate ={" "}
              {usd(tanklessFull.upgradeTotal)}<br />
              + $250 permit + $60 haul-away<br />
              total = <span class="font-bold text-amber-700">{usd(tanklessFull.total)}</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Result:</span> {usd(tanklessFull.total)} — roughly
              double the tank swap, and the appliance is only {fmt(tanklessFull.unitShare, 0)}% of it. The vent
              and the gas line are what make a conversion expensive, not the unit.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

